      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Postgres Workflow\n\n**Purpose**: n8n workflow: Postgres Workflow. 7 nodes wired together. Uses: postgres, filter, manualTrigger, scheduleTrigger, n8n. Sourced from czlonkowski/Zie619 n8n-workflows community archive (workflows/Postgres/0460_Postgres_Filter_Import_Scheduled.json). Configure credentials and any hardcoded IDs before activating.\n\n**Services needed**: postgres, filter, manualTrigger, scheduleTrigger, n8n, stopAndError\n\n**Difficulty**: 5min-config\n\n**Setup**:\n1. Configure credentials for the services above\n2. Update any hardcoded IDs / URLs\n3. Test with sample data before activating\n\n_Source: https://github.com/Zie619/n8n-workflows_\n_Curated by ai-ops-architect on 2026-05-05_",
